      "content": "Current design:\n[sequence] Budget overview:\n@startuml\nautonumber\ntitle View budget usage with warnings (REQ-005)\n\nparticipant TrackerPage\nparticipant ApiHandler\nparticipant ExpenseTrackerService\nparticipant BudgetRepository\nparticipant ExpenseRepository\nparticipant BudgetStatus\n\nTrackerPage -> ApiHandler : GET /api/budgets\nApiHandler -> ExpenseTrackerService : budget_overview()\nExpenseTrackerService -> BudgetRepository : list_all()\nBudgetRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : [Budget(Groceries, 10000), Budget(Transport, 5000)]\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseRepository : sum_by_category(2026, 5)\nExpenseRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : {Groceries: 8500}\nExpenseTrackerService -> BudgetStatus : evaluate(\"Groceries\", 10000, 8500)\nBudgetStatus -> BudgetStatus : percent_used() = 85.0\nBudgetStatus --> ExpenseTrackerService : BudgetStatus(level=NEAR_LIMIT, spent_cents=8500)\nExpenseTrackerService -> BudgetStatus : evaluate(\"Transport\", 5000, 12000)\nBudgetStatus --> ExpenseTrackerService : BudgetStatus(level=OVER, spent_cents=12000)\nExpenseTrackerService --> ApiHandler : [BudgetStatus, BudgetStatus]\nApiHandler --> TrackerPage : 200 {budgets: [{category, budget_display, spent_display, percent, level, message}]}\nTrackerPage -> TrackerPage : renderBudgets(), showMessage(\"85% of budget used\")\n\nnote over BudgetStatus\nlevel = OK below 80%, NEAR_LIMIT from 80% up to 100%,\nOVER above 100% of the category budget (REQ-005).\nend note\n@enduml\n\n\n[component] Components:\n@startuml\ntitle Runtime parts of the local expense tracker\n\nnode \"Local machine (no external network)\" {\n  component \"Browser page\\nindex.html + app.js + style.css\" as Browser\n  component \"expensetracker server\\npython -m expensetracker\\nhttp.server + JSON API\" as Server\n  database \"SQLite file\\ndata/expense_tracker.db\" as DB\n}\n\nBrowser --> Server : HTTP on 127.0.0.1:8000\\nGET /api/expenses, /api/budgets, /api/summary\\nPOST /api/expenses, /api/budgets\nServer --> DB : sqlite3 (Python stdlib)\n@enduml\n\n\n[class] Domain classes:\n@startuml\nskinparam classAttributeIconSize 0\n\nclass Money <<utility>> {\n  {static} + parse_amount(text : str) : int\n  {static} + format_cents(cents : int) : str\n}\n\nclass TrackerPage <<view>> {\n  + callApi(method : str, path : str, body : dict) : dict\n  + renderExpenses(expenses : list) : None\n  + renderBudgets(statuses : list) : None\n  + renderSummary(summary : dict) : None\n  + showMessage(text : str, is_error : bool) : None\n}\n\nclass Expense {\n  + id : int\n  + amount_cents : int\n  + spent_on : date\n  + category_id : int\n  + amount_display() : str\n}\n\nclass Category {\n  + id : int\n  + name : str\n}\n\nclass Budget {\n  + id : int\n  + category_id : int\n  + amount_cents : int\n  + amount_display() : str\n}\n\nenum BudgetLevel {\n  OK\n  NEAR_LIMIT\n  OVER\n}\n\nclass BudgetStatus {\n  + category_name : str\n  + budget_cents : int\n  + spent_cents : int\n  + level : BudgetLevel\n  + percent_used() : float\n  + message() : str\n  {static} + evaluate(category_name : str, budget_cents : int, spent_cents : int) : BudgetStatus\n}\n\nclass MonthlySummary {\n  + month : str\n  + total_cents : int\n  + by_category : dict\n  + total_display() : str\n  + category_display(category_name : str) : str\n}\n\nclass ExpenseTrackerService {\n  + add_expense(amount_text : str, date_text : str, category_name : str) : Expense\n  + list_expenses() : list\n  + set_budget(category_name : str, amount_text : str) : Budget\n  + budget_overview() : list\n  + monthly_summary() : MonthlySummary\n  + list_categories() : list\n}\n\nclass ExpenseRepository {\n  + insert(expense : Expense) : int\n  + list_newest_first() : list\n  + sum_by_category(year : int, month : int) : dict\n}\n\nclass BudgetRepository {\n  + upsert(category_id : int, amount_cents : int) : Budget\n  + find_by_category(category_id : int) : Budget\n  + list_all() : list\n}\n\nclass CategoryRepository {\n  + list_all() : list\n  + find_by_name(name : str) : Category\n  + seed_defaults() : None\n}\n\nclass AppDatabase {\n  + path : str\n  + connect() : Connection\n  + create_schema() : None\n  + execute(sql : str, params : tuple) : Cursor\n}\n\nclass ApiHandler {\n  + do_GET() : None\n  + do_POST() : None\n  + route_get(path : str) : tuple\n  + route_post(path : str, body : dict) : tuple\n  + send_json(status : int, payload : dict) : None\n  + send_static(path : str) : None\n}\n\nclass TrackerServer {\n  + port : int\n  + start() : None\n}\n\nclass ValidationError {\n  + field : str\n  + message : str\n}\n\nTrackerPage --> ApiHandler : JSON over HTTP >\nExpenseTrackerService o-- ExpenseRepository\nExpenseTrackerService o-- BudgetRepository\nExpenseTrackerService o-- CategoryRepository\nExpenseTrackerService ..> Money\nExpenseTrackerService ..> BudgetStatus\nExpenseTrackerService ..> MonthlySummary\nExpenseTrackerService ..> ValidationError\nExpenseRepository --> AppDatabase\nBudgetRepository --> AppDatabase\nCategoryRepository --> AppDatabase\nApiHandler --> ExpenseTrackerService\nApiHandler ..> ValidationError\nTrackerServer --> ApiHandler\nExpense --> Category : categorised by >\nBudget --> Category : limit for >\nExpense --> Money : displayed with >\nBudget --> Money : displayed with >\nBudgetStatus --> Budget : reports on >\nBudgetStatus --> Category : for >\nMonthlySummary --> Expense : totals >\n@enduml\n\n\n[activity] Expense validation flow:\n@startuml\ntitle Validate and save an expense (REQ-002, REQ-010)\n\nstart\n:User submits amount, date, category;\n:Money.parse_amount and date parse;\nif (amount missing, non-numeric or <= 0?) then (yes)\n  :400 {field: \"amount\", message};\n  :Keep entered values in the form;\n  stop\nelse (no)\n  if (date not a valid calendar date?) then (yes)\n    :400 {field: \"date\", message};\n    :Keep entered values in the form;\n    stop\n  else (no)\n    if (category not in the fixed list?) then (yes)\n      :400 {field: \"category\", message};\n      stop\n    else (no)\n      :ExpenseRepository.insert(Expense with amount_cents);\n      :201 with amount_display;\n      :Append the row to the expense list and show \"Expense saved\";\n      stop\n    endif\n  endif\nendif\n@enduml\n\n\n[sequence] Log expense:\n@startuml\nautonumber\ntitle Log an expense (REQ-002, REQ-003, REQ-008, REQ-010)\n\nparticipant TrackerPage\nparticipant ApiHandler\nparticipant ExpenseTrackerService\nparticipant CategoryRepository\nparticipant ExpenseRepository\n\nTrackerPage -> ApiHandler : POST /api/expenses {amount: \"12.50\", date: \"2026-05-03\", category: \"Groceries\"}\nApiHandler -> ExpenseTrackerService : add_expense(\"12.50\", \"2026-05-03\", \"Groceries\")\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseTrackerService : Money.parse_amount(\"12.50\") = 1250\nExpenseTrackerService -> CategoryRepository : find_by_name(\"Groceries\")\nCategoryRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : Category(id=1, name=Groceries)\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseRepository : insert(Expense(amount_cents=1250, spent_on=2026-05-03, category_id=1))\nExpenseRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : 7\nExpenseTrackerService --> ApiHandler : Expense(id=7)\nApiHandler --> TrackerPage : 201 {id: 7, amount_display: \"12.50\"}\nTrackerPage -> ApiHandler : GET /api/expenses\nApiHandler -> ExpenseTrackerService : list_expenses()\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseRepository : list_newest_first()\nExpenseRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : [Expense(id=7), ...]\nExpenseTrackerService --> ApiHandler : list\nApiHandler --> TrackerPage : 200 {expenses: [...]}\nTrackerPage -> TrackerPage : renderExpenses(), showMessage(\"Expense saved\")\n\nnote over ApiHandler\nInvalid amount or date: ValidationError is caught here and answered\nwith 400 {field, message}; nothing is inserted and the page keeps\nthe entered values (REQ-002, REQ-010).\nend note\n@enduml\n\n\n[sequence] Monthly summary:\n@startuml\nautonumber\ntitle Monthly spending summary (REQ-006, REQ-009)\n\nparticipant TrackerPage\nparticipant ApiHandler\nparticipant ExpenseTrackerService\nparticipant ExpenseRepository\nparticipant MonthlySummary\n\nTrackerPage -> ApiHandler : GET /api/summary\nApiHandler -> ExpenseTrackerService : monthly_summary()\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseRepository : sum_by_category(2026, 5)\nExpenseRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : {Groceries: 4000, Transport: 6000}\nExpenseTrackerService -> MonthlySummary : by_category = sums, total_cents = 10000\nMonthlySummary --> ExpenseTrackerService : summary\nExpenseTrackerService -> MonthlySummary : total_display() = \"100.00\"\nExpenseTrackerService -> MonthlySummary : category_display(\"Groceries\") = \"40.00\"\nMonthlySummary --> ExpenseTrackerService : \"40.00\"\nExpenseTrackerService --> ApiHandler : MonthlySummary(month=\"2026-05\")\nApiHandler --> TrackerPage : 200 {month, total_display: \"100.00\", categories: [{name, total_display}]}\nTrackerPage -> TrackerPage : renderSummary()\n\nnote over ExpenseRepository\nSUM(amount_cents) GROUP BY category_id filtered by\nspent_on between the first and last day of the month;\nrows from other months are excluded by the query (REQ-006).\nend note\n@enduml\n\n\n[sequence] Set budget:\n@startuml\nautonumber\ntitle Set or update a monthly budget (REQ-004)\n\nparticipant TrackerPage\nparticipant ApiHandler\nparticipant ExpenseTrackerService\nparticipant CategoryRepository\nparticipant BudgetRepository\n\nTrackerPage -> ApiHandler : POST /api/budgets {category: \"Groceries\", amount: \"350.00\"}\nApiHandler -> ExpenseTrackerService : set_budget(\"Groceries\", \"350.00\")\nExpenseTrackerService -> ExpenseTrackerService : Money.parse_amount(\"350.00\") = 35000\nExpenseTrackerService -> CategoryRepository : find_by_name(\"Groceries\")\nCategoryRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : Category(id=1)\nExpenseTrackerService -> BudgetRepository : upsert(1, 35000)\nBudgetRepository --> ExpenseTrackerService : Budget(id=3, category_id=1, amount_cents=35000)\nExpenseTrackerService --> ApiHandler : Budget\nApiHandler --> TrackerPage : 200 {category: \"Groceries\", budget_display: \"350.00\"}\nTrackerPage -> TrackerPage : showMessage(\"Budget saved\"), update Groceries row\n\nnote over ApiHandler\nNegative, missing or non-numeric amount: 400 {field: \"amount\",\nmessage}; no budget row is written (REQ-004, REQ-010).\nend note\n@enduml\n\n\n[use_case] Use cases:\n@startuml\nleft to right direction\nskinparam packageStyle rectangle\n\nactor \"Local user\" as User\n\nrectangle \"Expense Tracker (local web app)\" {\n  usecase \"Start the tracker server\" as UC1\n  usecase \"Log an expense\" as UC2\n  usecase \"View recorded expenses\" as UC3\n  usecase \"Set a monthly category budget\" as UC4\n  usecase \"View budget usage and warnings\" as UC5\n  usecase \"View monthly spending summary\" as UC6\n}\n\nUser --> UC1\nUser --> UC2\nUser --> UC3\nUser --> UC4\nUser --> UC5\nUser --> UC6\n\nUC2 ..> UC3 : <<include>>\nUC5 ..> UC6 : <<include>>\nUC5 ..> UC4 : <<extend>>\n@enduml\n"
